[BEGIN]
  ObjTp=Hd
  Cmn1=EtherGate Controller v1.0\\\\Owns the connection for one DIN EtherGate.
  Cmn2=||1The address is static, or a\\DHCP reservation that does not move.
  Cmn3=||1Nothing connects until Connect is\\high. Releasing Connect stops||1
  Cmn4=the session. Connected_FB rises only after\\the gateway accepts||1
  Cmn5=a connection. Art-Net streams while that feedback is high.\\\\IP_Address||1
  Cmn6=is the commissioned address. IP_Address_Override$ is ignored\\until||1
  Cmn7=a string arrives. After that, the serial is the address, even if\\
  Cmn8=it is empty. 0.0.0.0 does not open a socket.\\\\Port universe parameters||1
  Cmn9=are the Art-Net universes this processor\\transmits. Each universe||1
  Cmn10=override is ignored until an analog value\\arrives. After that,||1
  Cmn11=the analog is the universe, and 0 is universe 0.\\\\Controller chooses||1
  Cmn12=which of 8 gateways this symbol uses. Controller_Override\\is ignored||1
  Cmn13=until an analog value arrives. After that, 1-8 selects that\\slot.
  Cmn14=||1One Controller symbol per slot.\\\\The mode strings come from the||1
  Cmn15=HTTP poll. Until a body is parsed\\they stay at "poll pending" /||1
  Cmn16="unparsed". Streaming does not wait\\on that poll.
[END]
